{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41140","headline":"次韵徐爽见寄 · 胡宿","name":"次韵徐爽见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五两青丝帝渥深，平时可敢叹英沈。\n侏儒自是长三尺，澼絖都来直数金。\n寂寞死灰人丧偶，婆娑生意树交阴。\n年来想见琼枝色，久梦蘧蘧到竹林。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"胡宿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41140.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41140","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《唐诗鼓吹》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/唐詩鼔吹_(四庫全書本)）"}